        {
          "text": "I asked, “",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", why is the land devastated and dry as a desert, so that no one travels through it? Who is wise enough to understand this? To whom have you explained it so that he can tell others?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
