            "verseId": "JER.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " answered, “This has happened because my people have abandoned the teaching that I gave them. They have not obeyed me or done what I told them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Instead, they have been stubborn and have worshipped the idols of Baal as their ancestors taught them to do. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So then, listen to what I, the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " Almighty, the God of Israel, will do: I will give my people bitter plants to eat and poison to drink. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will scatter them among nations that neither they nor their ancestors have heard about, and I will send armies against them until I have completely destroyed them.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
