            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.25",
              "JER.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " says, “The time is coming when I will punish the people of Egypt, Judah, Edom, Ammon, Moab, and the desert people, who have their hair cut short.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.25+JER.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.25",
              "JER.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9.25–26",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "hair cut short",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": ": The desert people cut their hair short in honour of their god, a pagan practice forbidden to the Israelites (see Lev 19.27).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " All these people are circumcised, but have not kept the covenant it symbolizes. None of these people and none of the people of Israel have kept my covenant.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.9.25+JER.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.9.25",
